        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Updates for Safari TP 254]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30822</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30822"/>
        <updated>2026-10-09T12:31:24.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">The <a href="https://collector.openwebdocs.org/" rel="nofollow">https://collector.openwebdocs.org/</a> project (v10.20.15) found new features shipping in Safari Technical Preview 254 on macOS 27 which was released today. Currently, the collector covers about 90% of BCD, so the following list might not be exhaustive.</p>
<p dir="auto">Release notes: <a href="https://webkit.org/blog/18420/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-254/" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/blog/18420/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-254/</a></p>
<p dir="auto">New (<strong>bold</strong>) and updated keys:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>css.properties.link-parameters</li>
<li>css.properties.link-parameters.none</li>
<li>css.properties.list-style-type.symbols</li>
<li>css.properties.list-style.symbols</li>
<li>css.properties.max-lines.none (removal) (no longer in spec)</li>
<li><strong>css.properties.max-size</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.max-size.fit-content</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.max-size.max-content</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.max-size.min-content</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.max-size.none</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.max-size.stretch</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.min-size</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.min-size.auto</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.min-size.fit-content</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.min-size.max-content</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.min-size.min-content</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.properties.min-size.stretch</strong></li>
<li><strong>css.types.random-item</strong></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Notes:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>The release notes also mention border-*-radius side shorthands and interpolate-size, but I didn't see that supported yet.</li>
<li>For wasm wide arithmetic, see <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5776062030" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30813" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30813/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30813">#30813</a></li>
</ul>]]></content>
