        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Firefox Nightly supports wasm type reflection]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30815</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30815"/>
        <updated>2026-10-09T10:37:04.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Firefox Nightly supports wasm type reflection.</p>
