    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add `console.context()` static method]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30814</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30814"/>
        <updated>2026-10-09T09:42:36.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126397667?u=3b8d9424f1a16860e2ee3c84887049f89cbaf37c&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Adds <code class="notranslate">api.console.context_static</code> for the non-standard <code class="notranslate">console.context()</code> method, so the new MDN page requested in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5746060804" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46017" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/46017/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46017">mdn/content#46017</a> has compat data.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Chrome 61: the method was added in V8 commit <a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/v8/v8/commit/701d79d08ad4/hovercard" href="https://github.com/v8/v8/commit/701d79d08ad4">v8/v8@<tt>701d79d08ad4</tt></a> (June 2017), which is in V8 6.1 (<code class="notranslate">6.1.534.32</code> contains it, <code class="notranslate">6.0.286.52</code> does not). V8 6.1 shipped in Chrome 61. Confirmed present in Chrome 154.</li>
<li>Firefox: not supported, <a href="https://bugzil.la/1948870" rel="nofollow">https://bugzil.la/1948870</a> is still open.</li>
<li>Safari: not supported, <a href="https://webkit.org/b/293768" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/b/293768</a> is still open.</li>
<li>Deno: <code class="notranslate">typeof console.context</code> is <code class="notranslate">"undefined"</code> in Deno 2.7.5 (tracking issue <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3108971415" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/29560" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/denoland/deno/issues/29560/hovercard" href="https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/29560">denoland/deno#29560</a>).</li>
<li>Node.js 8.7.0: first release with V8 6.1 (<code class="notranslate">deps/v8/include/v8-version.h</code>), and its <code class="notranslate">lib/internal/bootstrap_node.js</code> already copies V8-only console methods onto the Node.js console. Marked as partial because messages are only sent to an attached inspector (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2794011602" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/56634" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/nodejs/node/issues/56634/hovercard" href="https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/56634">nodejs/node#56634</a>). I confirmed that behavior in Node.js 22.14 using <code class="notranslate">inspector.Session</code> and <code class="notranslate">Runtime.consoleAPICalled</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">npm run lint</code> passes apart from the expected 404 warning for the <code class="notranslate">mdn_url</code>, which the mdn/content PR adds.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto">Relates to <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5746060804" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46017" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/46017/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46017">mdn/content#46017</a></p>]]></content>
